# Gauss-Legendre node/weight disk cache.
#
# xc-spectral consumes GL quadrature internally (mellin transforms and
# the ccm::hp τ-build), so a run from this crate's cwd writes GL
# fixtures here as `<cwd>/data/gl_cache/`. The generated
# `.json` / `.json.zip` files are gitignored (see /.gitignore); this
# `.gitkeep` keeps the directory structure in the repo so the layout is
# self-documenting and present on a fresh clone.
#
# Public consolidated fixtures live at:
#   https://github.com/TeamXcelerator/xcelerator-gl-cache
